TI  - The relationship between having a regular general practitioner (GP) and the experience of healthcare barriers: a cross-sectional study among young people in NSW, Australia, with oversampling from marginalised groups.
AU  - Kang, Melissa
AU  - Robards, Fiona
AU  - Luscombe, Georgina
